      "mergedPostDetails": "In a specific world that I have uploaded, an infinite loop always occurs during the multi-platform build process.  \n\nWhen I specify both Windows and Android builds simultaneously, the build process continuously alternates between Windows and Android, never stopping.  \n\nI have uploaded several other worlds, and in those cases, the expected behavior occurs (i.e., the process completes after building once for Windows and once for Android).\n\nI am unsure what makes this particular world different.  \n\nIf you need any logs or additional information, please let me know.  \n\nI would appreciate your support in resolving this issue.\n\n（日本語要約）\n\n私がアップロードしております、ある特定のワールドのマルチプラットフォームビルドにおいて、必ず無限ループが発生します。\n\nWindows ビルドと Android ビルドを同時に指定すると、Windows ビルドと Android ビルドが交互に無限にビルドされつづける状態です。",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Infinite Loop Occurs in Multi-Platform Builds of Worlds (SDK 3.7.6)",
